
@endpoint = http://localhost:3000/Api/V1/Purchases

###

### creating a purchase
# @name postApurchase
POST {{endpoint}} HTTP/3.0
Content-Type: application/json

{
"id":"2",
"type":"washing",
"amount":20.99,
"date":"2026-01-06"
}

### getting a purchase (the last one based off of the same id)
@newPurchase = {{postApurchase.response.body._id}}
GET {{endpoint}}/{{newPurchase}} Http/3.0
Content-Type: application/json


### updating purchase but theirs no need to currently 
@updatePurchase = {{postApurchase.response.body._id}}
PUT {{endpoint}}/{{updatePurchase}} HTTP/3.0
Content-Type: application/application/json

{
    "type":"Clothes",
    "amount":7.46
}


